__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>
